# Visual Studio / Rider ile elle deneme. Once: scripts\db-up.ps1, sonra API'yi "https" profiliyle calistirin.
# Ornek kullanicilar (yalnizca gelistirme): ayse@acme.demo, mehmet@beta.demo, deniz@ortak.demo
# Sifre: Modulix.Demo1

@Modulix.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7026

### Giris (tek uyeligi olan kullanicida tenant otomatik secilir)
POST {{Modulix.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "deniz@ortak.demo",
  "password": "Modulix.Demo1"
}

### Oturumdaki kullanici ve uyelikleri
GET {{Modulix.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me

### Aktif tenant secimi (tenantId'yi /me cevabindan alin)
POST {{Modulix.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/active-tenant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

### Aktif tenant
GET {{Modulix.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenant/current

### Cikis
POST {{Modulix.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout

### Saglik kontrolu
GET {{Modulix.Api_HostAddress}}/health
